<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nineveh khuo puohgih, Elkosh khuo a um Nahum mengmuna laibu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian khu thangsiet hat ahia, Mangpa’n phuba ala hi. Mangpa’n phuba ala a, lungthahnain adim hi; Mangpa’n ama doute tungah phuba ala ding a, Amelmate adingin thangpaina akholkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa alungthahbai sih a, nasatah a silbawlthei a hi, Migilou siem atangsah, ngai mawngmawng sih ding a, Mangpa’n pingpei leh, huipi lah ah lampi anei a, meilumte khu akenga leivuite ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’n tuipi aphawh a akangsah a, luipite zousie akanggaw sah hi. Bashan leh Karmel avuoigawp sah a, Lebanon pah lunlaite avul sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amasangah taangte akiling a muolte azunmang hi; Amasang ah lei akatum a, khovel leh asunga umte zousie toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungthahna masanga ding ngam ding koi ahiei? koi ahiei alungthahna zauhuoina thuoh zou ding? A lungthahna khu mei banga sunbuoh in aum a, tualeh suongpite Aman asepkehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa ahoi a, lungkhambuoi ni a kulpi dettah ahi a, Ama’n ama muongte athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh tuisang luonglet zangin, amelmate asubei dinga, mielna in agalte anuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa douna a bang ahiei na phielguh uh? Aman asubei sieng kilkel dinga, suhgentheina niveina atung nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen amaute ling banga zieltom leh, zukhamhatte banga zukham a a um lai un, bupawl gaw bangin akatum sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa tunga silgilou ngaituo leh, lemguot mi giloutah khat, nang akipat in ahing pawtdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Amaute bittah in um nan u’leh, tualeh khumbangin tampi um nan u’leh zong, a lah uh ahing tot chiengin, tuabang a satkhieh in a um ding uhi. Nang hing na sugentheita nanleng zong, Kang sugenthei nawnsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen tuin nang akipat in, ahahkol ka sutawng dinga, na kolbute ka phelkhe ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n nangma tungtangah, thupieh khat apeta hi: “Na min umsah ngitnget ding, hahlesuon nanei nawn sih ding hi. Na pasien innte akipat in na milim, khenthute leh sunthute ka satkhe dinga, na han ka tou ding,” na gitlou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Taangte tunga khantanhoi, kipahna thupha hing puohpa leh, lungmuonna thu phuongpa kengte endi ua! Aw Juda na pawi guot tuomte mang inlen, na thuchiem sutangtung in, aziehpen migilouten ahing dou nawn sih ding uhi, amaute suhmangthai ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Satzahpa na masang ah ahing peitou hi: Kulpite ah vengmi koi inlen, lampi veng hoiin, Na kawngte uh hatsah unlen, Na tha uh khausah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen Israel vangletna bangin, Jakob vangletna, Mangpa’n apekia ding hi. A su awng miten amauh asu awng zouta ua, a grep bate uh asuseta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mihatte lumte khu san sah ahi a, a mihangsanten puonsandup asil uhi, Akisahkhol ni un asakollengte uh, meisel kuong sengsong bang in avah a, ateipite uh ate setsot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kidouna sakollengte kholai dung a, lam liente ah khat leh khat akiphutuo butbut uhi; Meisel kuong abang ua, tunphe bangin atai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman amiliente atheidoh a, alam peina uah akipalpua ua, kulbang lam zuon in akin pei ua, kidalna pan mun abawlkhol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Luipi kotpite akihongta a, leeng innpi suhbei ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami thupieh ahi: Huzzab sal a puimang ahi dinga, akivahkhang lien ding a; tualeh asuoh numeite un, a awm uh tum in, khuvanu bangin kap ngetngut kawm in, ama apui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nidanglai apat Nineveh khu tuikul bang ahi a, Tuin ataimangta uhi, “Khawl in, khawl in” chi’n akikou ua, hinanleh koima akinuahei aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dangkate galsumte lahpieh unlen, galsum lah in sanate lahpieh un, Sil hoi kikholkhawm leh athupina in, tawpni anei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama khu ahawmguoh, bangmalou leh kisegawp ahita! Lungtangte azunmanga, khupte akithing hi; tahsa tung chinteng ana siengta a, Amaite zousie uh amuol siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koima suhzau lou a aumna uh, humpibahnei talte, humpibahnei pite leh, humpibahnei noute avah kawina u’leh, humpibahnei tenna mun leh, humpibahnei noute ann nehna hei tah atai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Humpibahnei tal in anoute khamkhop ding abotnen a, humpibahnei pite a dingin akeilia pieh hi, abuh sungte asamat in adim sah a, akohawmte asamatte luongin adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai vawi, ka hing dou ahi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Na sakollengte uh mei in ka hal khu liai luoi ding a, na humpibahnei hatlaite uh namsau in athatgam dinga; tualeh leitung akipat in na samatte ka sutawp ding a, tualeh na thangkoute aw, akiza nawn mawngmawng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sisan suohat khopi tung agih hi; zuou leh kisuomna in adim siengta a, Suomhatte nang a kipat apeimang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kizepna khauhuol ging leh, Sakolleng keng kigawt gingte, Sakol ketot gingte bang, sakolleng tai vutvut gingte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakol tungtuong miten a namsau valsetsot leh, ateipi tesetsette uh alaam ua, akithatlia mitampi a um ua, mishi luong atam atam a um uhi; mishi luong simsenglou a lum pheng phung a, tua mishi luongte tungah akipalpua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate khu kizuanu melhoi huasanna zieh leh, a angkawmnate zieh a, Hagau lam a muonhuoi louna ahisihleh gin umlouna. Namte zua a, adawi aisan siem zieh a, innkuonte zua dawi ai san siemnu zieh a hing um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n Ngai vawi, ka hing dou ahi achi hi, Na puonten na mailam ah ka hawh dinga, na saguohna namte ka musah ding hi. Na zumhuoina leenggam ten ka ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Silnieh kidahhuoitah na tungah Kang the ding a, zumhuoitah in ka hing bawl dinga, etnop huoi in Kang koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Nang hing en zousie in, ahing taimangsan ding ua, Nineveh asegawpta, Koi ahiei ama suun ding? Nang dingin hamuonna heilang ka suita ding adiei? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nile luipi gei a um, akimvel a tuiin akuolkhum tuipi akulbang imna hi a, tuite akulbang hi, No Amon sangin na hoizaw amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia leh Izipt ahatna ahi a, Tawp chin neilou ahi, Put leh Lubim khu nang hing panpite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh puimangin a um a, Sal ding in apeita hi, Ata ngehte uzong kholai dung teng ah, tuolsatnan anei uhi. Kholai dung lamka thuom chinteng ah, ami zatat huoite ua dingin ai asan uhi, amiliente zousie siakhau a kaan in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang zong na dawnkham dinga, phuol in na um ding hi; Melmate akipat bitna dingin, kibutna na sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kulpi zousie theipi ga min masa, theipi kung abang ding ua, akinuh chiengin, anete kamsung ah akesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adihtah in na lah ua na mipite numei ahi ua, na gam kulkotpite khu na galte ua dingin, akihong lien dinga; Na kalna zawlte mei in akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Imchimit a na um sunga dingin, tui kitawi masah inlen, na kulpite sudet inlen, tungman umna ah pei inlen, azutmatnate chil inlen tehlei a kibawl bangte sudet in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khunah mei in nang ahing katum dinga, namsau in ahing sattan ding hi; tuami’n nang khauphe nehgam bangin, ahing negam ding hi. Khauphe bangin nouma leh nouma kipungsah unlen, khaukhuppite bangin nouma leh nouma kisupung un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na summetbawl mite uh, van aasite sanga tamzaw in na tamsah zawta hi; khauphete’n anegam ua, aleengmangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na galkap liente khauphe hon tampi bang ahi ua, na galkap lamkaite khu khovot ni a, dai dawn a khauphe hon boh khepkhup bang ahi uhi, hinanleh ni ahing sat chiengin aleengmang ua, a umna mun uh akithei nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Assiria leengpa na belampute uh a imu ua, na miliente leivui lah ah akhawldam uhi. Na mipite muolte tungah akithezah ua, Amaute koiman apuikhawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na liemna damna ding a um sih a, na liemna anase mama hi. Na tungtang thuthang zakha poumain, akhut uh ahing behkhum ding uhi; aziehpen na gitlouna bei theilou, athuoh khalou a um mawngmawng amah?
  </para>
</usx>
